  "description": "Brief Description of Proposed Works:\n\nThe works include internal alterations to Flat 51, Lauderdale Tower, Barbican Estate, including the removal of non-structural partitions and doors forming Bedroom 4, resulting in the enlargement of both Bedroom 3 and the living room. A new L-shaped partition will be constructed to create a larger Bedroom 3, with an additional entrance from the living room formed via a pair of glazed timber doors. Internal doors D1, D2, D3, D4, D6, D7, D8, D9, and D10 will be replaced with new full-height doors in a style sympathetic to the original, and selected doors and frames (D4, D8, D9) will be relocated. These changes are part of wider refurbishment works to the bathroom and WC areas and are designed to respect the original architectural character of the flat.\n",
